[Music]  a powerful earthquake hit yesterday in  mexico so far leaving at least one  person dead it hit near the pacific  resort city of acapulco now the quake  was last night but as expected there  have been powerful aftershocks all day  reporter sally jaramillo in studio  tonight with some reaction for us at 6.  denise the earthquake registered as a  7.0 located only 10 miles northeast of  acapulco now let's zoom in we do want to  show you a better image  where of course  these lights were appearing in the  atmosphere and many sharing these images  on social media today i spoke to paulina  cuevas who lives in las vegas she used  to live in acapulco and says her family  who is still there says it was awful  they are okay but soon after the quake  her friends started sending her images  and videos she described as chaotic she  says it reminded her of the earthquake  there in 2017.  i saw like every um the supermarket um  the hotels the like the plazas  everything is damaged like the all the  crystals  cuevas says her friends also telling her  they couldn't sleep due to all the  aftershocks there were more than 200  after the earthquake now her message  tonight to be strong and help our people  in mexico by donating to the mexican red  cross reporting in studio sally  jaramillo 8 news now

